# NAME: Ads-Reject
# DESC: Focused ad/telemetry reject rules for Quantumult X.
# NOTE: Keep this resource before broad DIRECT/Tencent/Google rules.
# Updated for common apps used on iOS: WeChat/QQ, TikTok, X, Spotify, JD, YouTube and common ad SDKs.

